OL,3,GNEWSADivorced after five days: 'My sham
OL,4,Ahusband made me believe he loved me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive days after her Islamic wedding,
OL,7,FJane received a text message which
OL,8,Fturned her life upside down.
OL,10,F"I divorce you and have divorced you,"
OL,11,Fwrote her new husband.
OL,13,FJane - whose real name the BBC has
OL,14,Fagreed not to publish - said she had
OL,15,Fmet him on the Muslim marriage website
OL,16,FMuzz 10 months earlier.
OL,18,FAt the time, she believed he was called
OL,19,FAdam and that he lived in Manchester.
